{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:23:294","content":{"id":294,"title":"为什么","content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"1707ea2f-3549-4adb-92ab-dea239a77305","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"两个好处："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","collabId":"df14f267-1826-406c-917d-1802ff123285","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"52fd2033-96e3-4294-980e-34442f5c06f8","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"6e622a10-4f57-4007-97db-9879f3a6925b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对抗遗忘，艾宾浩斯遗忘曲线，人高估自己的记忆，其实忘东西忘得特别快"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"788ff659-e5bd-4d7e-8554-1ab0e0ecde47","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"7149b20a-bc47-49a9-b879-c98f4c8ef00c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"帮助知识内化，记了不等于懂了，要深度理解，消化吸收，思考的越多，记得就越多，记忆是思考的残留，不断回顾，刺激思考"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","collabId":"f2f652ce-0374-4418-a87c-b183ad213a02","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"9b333544-0658-48ec-93d4-0b8352d5ee66","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"73fb27e6-f6bd-42aa-9f3d-fcdbf3dda076","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"知识就像人体结构，不能仅仅靠吃（不断增加笔记）就能保持健康，还需要多锻炼，去肥增瘦"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","collabId":"b1a3ce9b-1a84-48b6-a3af-0c5b1cb3b74b","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"c6cd0e21-7cbe-444e-bc92-4c30ea47d3cc","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"03ead2ad-00cf-4e28-b898-2daa420972ab","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"控制输入"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"2e2517b1-02b5-42ed-ab9a-c4c961a79c71","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"4c4348c0-e6f7-4a9d-bac4-a20a9aeb6240","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"删减不需要的"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"a27ac55c-d3fe-4a0f-80ae-0c3210769f85","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"02b4a597-82cd-421b-9288-733e94e1a062","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"整理消化"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"dbb83e3c-92d5-42e7-b537-f197b0136216","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"182c5dd4-7c4b-4b73-b00a-44844dcb1e9a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"建立新知"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","collabId":"4edd8644-ac0a-4a0e-8151-aae4321fe8bc","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"cac6cb76-ba5d-4fd9-9a9c-0ac37e6c5c98","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"6d67302f-26fa-4691-bfdf-c0ef1b2a88f2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"突然意识到一条笔记似乎可以和另一条笔记联系起来，给笔记重新归类，添加新标签，添加新联系"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"ee494408-5b99-4e02-b876-ed6e16feb94c","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"cb65c561-4d5e-41af-a7b9-f019fb1cfda0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"影响现实，把知识用起来"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","collabId":"8fb1b1c7-0a36-43ac-a39c-e21640b2a44a","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"a507c9fd-365e-4cd7-92a6-29e56e0613e6","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"de644a50-1881-4455-bcf1-c8ca87ca4cc2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"行动原则，目标规划，置顶，时常看，防止走偏"}]}]}]}]}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"9f5cd3cc-900c-401f-93a1-1b32c5b5613f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"回顾过去的小确幸，提升幸福感，看到过去的坏心情，释怀一笑"}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"笔记的方法","target":{"key":"doc:project:23:275","type":"doc","id":275}},{"label":"记录篇，如何记笔记，做好信息预处理","target":{"key":"doc:project:23:281","type":"doc","id":281}},{"label":"通过回顾持续刺激","target":{"key":"doc:project:23:293","type":"doc","id":293}},{"label":"为什么","target":{"key":"doc:project:23:294","type":"doc","id":294}}],"prevPage":{"title":"通过回顾持续刺激","target":{"key":"doc:project:23:293","type":"doc","id":293}},"nextPage":{"title":"建议和做法","target":{"key":"doc:project:23:296","type":"doc","id":296}},"createTime":1743740793033,"updateTime":1792337068149,"projectId":23},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1792337068149}}